  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRC - Enhancing Safety, Agency, and Resilience of Women in Northern Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project directly contributes to advancing the core priorities of combating all forms of violence against women and girls and promoting women&#x2019;s leadership and economic empowerment. Through an integrated protection and economic recovery approach, DRC, in partnership with YWU, will address both the immediate protection needs and the structural drivers of gender inequality in Northern Yemen, resulting in reduced exposure to protection risks, increased agency, and enhanced socio-economic resilience of women and girls.</narrative>
  </description>
